{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44769","headline":"赠司空拾遗 · 大易","name":"赠司空拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侍臣何事辞云陛，江上微云见雪花。\n望阁未承丹凤诏，掩门空对楚人家。\n陈琳草奏才还在，王粲登楼兴未赊。\n高馆更容尘外客，仍令归路待瑶华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"大易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}